<title>USA: CellStar stake cut by Brightpoint.</title>
<headline>CellStar stake cut by Brightpoint.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Wednesday it cut its stake in CellStar Corp to 400,000 common shares or 2.1 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the company said its latest transactions include the sale of 600,000 common shares on January 31 at prices ranging from $22.125 to $22.75 per share.</p>
<p>CellStar, based in Carrollton, Texas, is an integrated wholesale distributor and retailer of cellular telephones and related products.</p>
<p>Brightpoint, based in Indianapolis, Ind., distributes wireless communication equipment.</p>
